          "i": 8,
          "preview": "$$ 19A = 57 \\\\qquad \\\\Rightarrow \\\\qquad A = 3 $$"
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "preview": "The loading law is therefore $P(u)=3u^{0.75}$, exactly as the claim states."
        }
